(text "U706 VCC33 and DIR pull-up share a local 3.3 V derived from USB5.\nENn_CC stays HIGH until USB5 and local 3.3 V are qualified (20 ms nominal).\nNo U706 control pin is pulled to independently supplied IO3V3.\nCC and superspeed pin limits are independent of the logic supply (TI table 5.1)." (at 15.24 245.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "88755b98-b09c-484e-8bb1-7ac54bd2f25e"))
